  "bodyHash": "v0fMJtbHwfc=",
  "content": "<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\"\n    alt=\"特色功能\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img\n    width=\"80%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/049bbd21fa6bffe1c747d1686aab04ee4086d8fd.gif\"\n    alt=\"特色功能\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<span>\n我们精心制作了这款附加组件，为您带来以新版Minecraft更新为灵感的主题。 <br> <strong>目前仅支持Fabric，如果需求足够，我们会考虑移植到其他加载器和版本！</strong><br>未来我们计划增加更多功能，欢迎加入我们的Discord分享您的想法！\n<br>\n  <br>\n<strong>警告！这是一个服务端模组。请勿在带反作弊系统的服务器上使用，否则可能导致封号。</strong>\n</span>\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/CXttaCyGCN\">\n  <img alt=\"Discord\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@mypunchymod\">\n  <img alt=\"TikTok\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c455866e8b8d992e586e9d61e5cd905dcc6c84de.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@punchyxp2\">\n  <img alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6ea4d87bf707d2f9f0bf59633d29ebede5c9fd7.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://github.com/punchy-mod/punchy-wiki/wiki/\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/modinpunchy\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\">\n</a>\n\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <div>\n    <iframe \n      width=\"560\" \n      height=\"315\" \n      src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MUWsQ1Riu6U?autoplay=1&mute=1\" \n      title=\"YouTube视频播放器\" \n      frameborder=\"0\" \n      allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" \n      allowfullscreen>\n    </iframe>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\"\n    alt=\"特色功能\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img\n    width=\"220px\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b09dbb834c1380dbec2c950fb7091d806ba74d3.png\"\n    alt=\"特色功能\"\n  />\n<br>\n<br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/3b1ad2ea8ee2437387ede0a61bda0b2adcc6939d.gif\"\nalt=\"特色功能\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>扔木棍</summary>\n手持木棍并按下可配置按键时，玩家会将木棍扔向远处。幼狼会追出去叼回木棍，然后盯着玩家等待，直到玩家从它嘴里取走木棍。\n</details>\n  <br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/2acaefde40b0a9d544fb86eb4668d172b8a52986.gif\"\nalt=\"特色功能\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>与幼狼玩耍</summary>\n抱着幼狼时，按下“I”键可触发与它玩耍的动画。\n</details>\n<br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/9a0ea409bdb29da4b4c100d0885ee9d9328a4499.gif\"\nalt=\"特色功能\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>抱起幼年生物</summary>\n蹲下并右键点击，可抱起幼年生物。幼狼拥有专属动画。将其抱在怀里时按下“I”键。\n</details>\n<br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/08b7dd7279fd6c0ea622029e6ae248ecc0120a8e.gif\"\nalt=\"特色功能\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>吹口哨召唤幼狼</summary>\n按下可配置按键，可召唤1格区块范围内最近的幼狼。若拥有多只幼狼，按下备用按键可无视距离同时召唤所有幼狼。\n</details>\n\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
